 Al-Munkadir similarly. He said: I asked Muhammad about this Hadith and he said: \"I am not aware of a Hadith other than this from Umaimah bint Ruqaiqah.\" There is another woman named Umaimah who narrated from the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"},{"scope":"provider_assessment_metadata","source_grade":{"grade":"Sahih","name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir"},"source_url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fawazahmed0/hadith-api@df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/eng-tirmidhi/1597.json","text":"Source assessment — Ahmad Muhammad Shakir: Sahih"},{"scope":"provider_assessment_metadata","source_grade":{"grade":"Sahih","name":"Al-Albani"},"source_url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fawazahmed0/hadith-api@df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/eng-tirmidhi/1597.json","text":"Source assessment — Al-Albani: Sahih"},{"scope":"provider_assessment_metadata","source_grade":{"grade":"Hasan Sahih","name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf"},"source_url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fawazahmed0/hadith-api@df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/eng-tirmidhi/1597.json","text":"Source assessment — Bashar Awad Maarouf: Hasan Sahih"},{"scope":"provider_assessment_metadata","source_grade":{"grade":"Isnaad Sahih","name":"Zubair Ali Zai"},"source_url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/fawazahmed0/hadith-api@df57907be35291c91ad6a6691180e22ca9920784/editions/eng-tirmidhi/1597.json","text":"Source assessment — Zubair Ali Zai: Isnaad Sahih"}],"grading":[{"grade":"Sahih","name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir"},{"grade":"Sahih","name":"Al-Albani"},{"grade":"Hasan Sahih","name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf"},{"grade":"Isnaad Sahih","name":"Zubair Ali Zai"}],"id":"fawaz:df57907be352:tirmidhi:1597:eng","language":"en","match_status":"same_source_record","provider_numbers":{"arabicnumber":1597,"hadithnumber":1597,"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":59}},"quotation_status":"bounded","references":[{"canonical_mapping_status":"not_inferred","collection":"Jami At Tirmidhi","number":"1597","numbering_system":"fawaz_api_hadithnumb